                        PayloadType.TASK_OUTPUT.toString());
            } else if (!terminateTask.getOutputData().isEmpty()) {
                output = terminateTask.getOutputData();
            }
        } else {
            TaskModel last = Optional.ofNullable(task).orElse(allTasks.get(allTasks.size() - 1));
